# Product scope

`project_scope.md` is the authoritative project specification. Before implementing or proposing a feature, check it against the product principles and non-goals in that document.

This platform is private-first and couple-centric. It is not a dating, hookup, anonymous social, or pornography platform.

When implementation details conflict with product integrity, privacy, consent, auditability, or safety, favour those constraints over implementation convenience.

Never silently invent a product rule. Surface the ambiguity instead.
